# Vercel's monorepo upload root is the repository root even though the linked
# application lives in apps/web. Keep production data, server-only code, local
# tooling, and repository metadata outside the web deployment boundary.
.git/
.github/
.vercel/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
node_modules/
data/
docs/
infra/
parser/
scripts/
supabase/
tools/
apps/agent/
packages/pal-catalog/
AGENTS.md
README.md

# Local/generated outputs and environment files are never deployment inputs.
**/.next/
**/.vercel/
**/node_modules/
**/coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
